 the project adds to the convenience and convenience of the residents.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Harshail Hornbill Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![1 BHK Flat in Harshail Hornbill in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 486477](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/3484/BHK_Configuration/517dc131976497adba7cff9d462d7d1f.webp)\n\n1 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n335 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n85 Lakh\n\n![Floor Plan of Harshail Hornbill in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 44004](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/3484/Floor%20Plan/b379babfa98066c312b1717524dfa21a.webp)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n## Key Features of Harshail Hornbill Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Iconic Lifestyle.\n* Excellent Architecture.\n* Best Convenience.\n* Ease Of Living.\n* Excellent Connectivity.\n* Contemporary Design.\n\n## Amenities Harshail Hornbill Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Intercom Facility\n* Lift\n* Power Back Up\n* Common Toilets\n* Solar Power\n* Yoga Room\n* Meditation Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* High-Speed Elevators\n* Parking and transportation\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n* Relaxation Zone\n* Reflexology Path\n* Grand Entrance Lobby\n\n* Reserved Parking\n* Maintenance Staff\n* Cctv For Common Areas\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n\n* Gymnasium\n* Kids Play Area\n* Indoor Games\n* Multipurpose Play Court\n* Jogging Track\n* Cycle Track\n\n* Community Club\n* Recreation/Kids Club\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vastu-compliant designs\n* Nature Walkway\n\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Organic Waste Convertor\n* Eco Life\n* Rainwater Harvesting\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Smart switches\n* Modular kitchen\n* Water Purifier\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Vitrified tile flooring\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Texture finish Walls\n* Concealed Electrification\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Geyser Point\n* Textured Paint\n\n## Walkthrough video Harshail Hornbill Malad West\n\n## Google Map Location of Harshail Hornbill Malad West\n\n## Locality Overview of Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Malad West](/location-review/mumbai/malad-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Malad West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Malad West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nHarshail Hornbill is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800029350](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800029350)\n\nProject: Harshail Hornbill\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Harshail Hornbill Malad West\n\n---\n\n* Durgadevi Saraf\n* Nagindas Khandwala College\n* Prahladrai Dalmia Lions College\n* Witty International School\n\n* Zenith Hospital\n* Jankanyan Charitable Hospital\n* Sun Multispeciality Hospital\n* Saraswati Hospital\n\n* Infiniti Mall\n* The Mall\n* Inorbit Mall\n* Growel 101 Mall\n\n* Monopoly\n* Mozzarella Pizza Hub\n* Exotic The Dining Bar\n* Domino's Pizza\n\n![Harshail Group](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/712_1678040177_harshail-logo.webp)\n\n## [Harshail Group](/mumbai/sale/builder/harshail-group-712)\n\nOngoing Projects: 2\n\nTotal Projects: 2\n\n---\n\nTwenty-five years of unparalleled expertise in the real estate industry by the Harshail Group thrives on redefining the skyline of Mumbai with its landmarks. From giving assurance of quality construction and superior designs to delivering it in reality, they have created a trustworthy experience with customers, investors and stakeholders.  \n  \nWith a diverse range of projects in the western suburbs and gradually improving and refining their resources, the Harshail Group envisions creating a legacy of commitment, customer satisfaction and design excellence. Their upcoming development, Harshail Hornbill, offers a perfect abode that reflects their distinctive style of meticulous planning concerning space, quality and experience that caters for the basic needs of comfort and luxury.  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by Harshail Group](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/harshail-group-712)\n\n## FAQ's about Harshail Hornbill Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Malad West\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Malad West\n\n* [Apartments in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n* [Studio Apartment in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property/studio-apartment)\n\n### Explore Projects in Malad West\n\n* [New Projects in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/possession/new-projects)\n* [Ready To Move Projects in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/possession/ready-to-move)\n\n### Homes by BHK in Malad West\n\n* [1BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/1bhk)\n* [2BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/2bhk)\n* [3BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/3bhk)\n* [4+ BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/4-plus-bhk)\n* [4BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/4bhk)\n\n### Homes by Budget in Malad West\n\n* [Homes in Malad West Above 5 Cr](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/budget/above-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Malad West Between 1 Cr to 2 Cr](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/budget/between-1-cr-to-2-cr)\n* [Homes in Malad West Between 2 Cr to 5 Cr](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/budget/between-2-cr-to-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Malad West Between 50 Lakh to 1 Cr](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/budget/between-50-lakh-to-1-cr)\n\n### Homes by View in Malad West\n\n* [Green View Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property-view/green-view)\n* [Open View Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property-view/open-view)\n\n### Explore Nearby Localities\n\n* [Homes in Goregaon East](/mumbai-goregaon.east/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Malad East](/mumbai-malad.east/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats)\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/harshail-hornbill/143102/project","title":"Harshail Hornbill, Malad West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹58.24 Lac Onwards | 1 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Harshail Real Estate Group developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/harshail-real-estate-group-8136.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Harshail Hornbill Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![Harshail Hornbill Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/harshail-hornbill-project-project-large-image1-7102.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Harshail Hornbill Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/harshail-hornbill-project-apartment-interiors5.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Harshail Hornbill Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/harshail-hornbill-project-apartment-interiors4-9264.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Harshail Hornbill Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-harshail-hornbill-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹58.24 Lac - 1.10 Cr**\n\n₹32,350 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Harshail Hornbill?\n\n## About Harshail Hornbill, Malad West by Harshail Real Estate Group\n\nHARSHAL HORNBILL, a magnificent residential project situated at Malad West, offers a unique blend of luxury, comfort, and convenience. Strategically located near prominent roads such as New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road, and Western Express Highway, the project provides seamless connectivity to major landmarks, commercial hubs, and educational institutions.\n\nExperience the epitome of living at HARSHAL HORNBILL, with its thoughtful amenities and specifications. The project features a state-of-the-art gymnasium, power backup, and oil-bound distemper finish on master bedroom walls. The thoughtfully designed apartments offer a range of options to suit various needs and budgets. From 1 BHK apartments to studios, each unit is a testament to the project s commitment to providing a comfortable and convenient lifestyle.\n\nChoose from a range of apartments that cater to your needs, with prices starting from 51.55 Lac for studios and going up to 97.09 Lac for 1 BHK apartments. Contact us today to book your dream home and experience the best of living at HARSHAL HORNBILL.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at HARSHAL HORNBILL:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| Studio | 180 | 51.55 Lac |\n| Studio | 208 | 59.57 Lac |\n| 1 BHK | 335 | 95.95 Lac |\n| 1 BHK | 339 | 97.09 Lac |\n\nThis real estate project boasts an enviable location, surrounded by a plethora of notable landmarks that cater to various needs, ensuring a seamless and comfortable living experience.\n\nWe have total 4 options available in Harshail Hornbill for resale and rental, In resale we have 2 properties available ranging from 1 BHK having sizes from 86.00 L - 88.00 L\n\nFor rent you can check 2 properties having options for 1 BHK with price ranging from 29,000.\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Listing Type | Total Listings | Unit Type Range | Price Range |\n| Resale | 2 | 1 BHK | 86.00 L - 88.00 L |\n| Rental | 2 | 1 BHK | 29,000 |\n\nThe recent government-registered transactions in the real estate market provide valuable insights into the current trends and patterns. Over the past three months, the sales market has witnessed a single transaction with a gross sales value of 5,500,000, highlighting the consistency and stability of the area. Moreover, a similar trend is observed over the six-month and one-year periods, indicating a steady and predictable market landscape with a single transaction and cumulative gross sales value of 5,500,000. The current rate for properties in the area stands at 14,946, providing a benchmark for investors and potential buyers.\n\n## Harshail Hornbill Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Harshail Hornbill.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Studio  180 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 58.24 Lac** | Check Availability |\n| Studio  208 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 67.30 Lac** | Check Availability |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  335 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.08 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  340 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.10 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nHarshail Hornbill's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malad West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Harshail Hornbill | Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 32350 | 30550 |\n| Mar 2026 | 23550 | 30150 |\n| Dec 2025 | 23100 | 28850 |\n| Sep 2025 | 22700 | 27900 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nHarshail Hornbill avg. price is ₹ 32.4 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malad West at ₹ 30.6 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Ajmera Shikhar](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ajmera-shikhar/231644/project \"Ajmera Shikhar\") | ₹ 36,100 |\n| Current Project **Harshail Hornbill** | ₹ 32,350 |\n| [Paradigm Antalya](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-antalya/100545/project \"Paradigm Antalya\") | ₹ 31,600 |\n| Malad West | ₹ 30,550 |\n| [Kabra Garnet](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kabra-garnet/232955/project \"Kabra Garnet\") | ₹ 30,500 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Harshail Hornbill start from ₹ 36.3 K with options available for 1 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Harshail Hornbill | In Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | ₹ 36.3 K | ₹ 38.3 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 62.4 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 80.4 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.3 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Harshail Hornbill.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Harshail Hornbill moved from ₹ 23,550/sqft to ₹ 32,350/sqft, reflecting a 37.37% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Harshail Hornbill moved from ₹ 23,100/sqft to ₹ 23,550/sqft, reflecting a 1.95% rise.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Harshail Hornbill moved from ₹ 22,700/sqft to ₹ 23,100/sqft, reflecting a 1.76% rise.\n\nA total of 97 out of 99 launched units have been booked as of December 2025, including 99% of 1 BHK(94 out of 95 units), 100% of 2 BHK(1 units), 1 RK(2 units).\n\nA total of 97 out of 99 launched units have been booked as of February 2025, including 99% of 1 BHK(94 out of 95 units), 100% of 2 BHK(1 units), 1 RK(2 units).\n\nMEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 85% done.\n\nA total of 80 out of 99 launched units have been booked as of December 2023, including 82% of 1 BHK(78 out of 95 units), 50% of 1 RK(1 out of 2 units), 100% of 2 BHK(1 units).\n\n## Harshail Hornbill Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 1 BHK 335 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Harshail Hornbill, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/harshail-hornbill-apartment-1-bhk-335sqft-20231429001423.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.08 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 1 BHK 340 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Harshail Hornbill, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/harshail-hornbill-apartment-1-bhk-339sqft-20231529001548.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.10 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 180 Sq. Ft. Studio in Harshail Hornbill, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 58.24 Lac\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 208 Sq. Ft. Studio in Harshail Hornbill, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 67.30 Lac\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Harshail Hornbill\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Harshail Hornbill to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Harshail Hornbill Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/harshail-hornbill-project-apartment-interiors5.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Harshail Hornbill Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/harshail-hornbill-project-apartment-interiors4-9264.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Harshail Hornbill Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-harshail-hornbill-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload brochure & master plan of Harshail Hornbill to explore floor plans and layout details in Malad West, Mumbai.\n\n### Project Brochure\n\nComplete details about the Project\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Harshail Hornbill\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-partyhal-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-rainwate-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Harshail Real Estate Group Malad West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around