Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-pranav-mettivilla-chsl-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Pranav Mettivilla CHS](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/pranav-mettivilla-chs/122721/project \"Pranav Mettivilla CHS\")\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Harshail Real Estate Group Track Record\n\n![Harshail Real Estate Group logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/harshail-real-estate-group-8136.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nHarshail Real Estate Group, a renowned developer in Mumbai, has been actively involved in the real estate industry for over 25 years. Known for their commitment to quality construction and exceptional designs, Harshail Group has successfully completed numerous projects in the city.With a portfolio that includes a wide range of residential properties, Harshail Real Estate Group has shown expertise in developing vacant plots, bungalow plot redevelopments, and even society building redevelopments, allowing for seamless transitions for property owners and tenants alike.Comprising various companies within its group, namely M/s. Shail Enterprises, M/s. Shail Builders, M/s. Harshmaan Developers, and M/s. Harshmaan Construction, Harshail Real Estate Group has a solid foothold in the western suburbs of Mumbai, specifically focusing on areas stretching from Bandra to Dahisar.Prospective homebuyers and investors can confidently trust Harshail Group to deliver properties that not only meet their expectations but also serve as long-term investments. With their customer-centered approach and years of experience, Harshail Real Estate Group sets itself apart in the competitive Mumbai real estate market.\n\n![Harshail Emerald residential project in Malad East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-harshail-emerald-project-flagship.j