ornbill in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Suraj Jadhav  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Rent in Harshail Hornbill in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Vijay Sharma  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK + Store Room Apartment For Rent in Harshail Hornbill in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Suraj Jadhav  profile picture]()\n![Ritesh Mishra]()\n\nSai Vijay Property Consultant\n\nAvanya Properties\n\n![Suraj Jadhav]()\n\nSai Properties\n\n![Vijay Sharma]()\n\nV.s.estates\n\n![Bhushan Ramdas Sawant]()\n\nShree Sadguru Properties\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Harshail Hornbill\n\n### What are the essential amenities provided in the Harshail Hornbill project?\n\nThe project offers a range of amenities, including a gymnasium, power backup, 24x7 security, rainwater harvesting, and indoor games.\n\n### What is the price range for units in this project?\n\nThe price range for units in Harshail Hornbill starts from 51.55 Lac for a studio apartment and goes up to 97.09 Lac for a 1 BHK apartment.\n\n### What are the available unit options in this project?\n\nThe project offers 1 BHK apartments, studio apartments, and two configurations with areas ranging from 180 to 339 square feet.\n\n### What is the current status of construction in the Harshail Hornbill project?\n\nThe project is currently in the mid-stage of construction.\n\n### Is the Harshail Hornbill project RERA-registered?\n\nYes, the project is RERA-registered with RERA registration number P51800029350.\n\n### What kind of flooring and fittings are provided in the homes?\n\nThe homes in Harshail Hornbill feature vitrified tiles flooring, oil-bound distemper walls, and premium bath fittings.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/asse