9147/29147-oth--1-.webp)\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\nHarshail Hornbill is a Residential Project by Harshail Group. It is a G+19 storey tower with 2 wings located at Malad West. 2 km from Malad Station, 0.5 km from Link Road. Close proximity to the social infrastructure. It offers 1 BHK Residences. Best quality material and fittings. Has all modern amenities and facilities. CCTV Surveillance for building common areas and all floors. It is a RERA approved project. Builder Posession 2023\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹27,404\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹42,500**\n\n36% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Malad West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹27,000/sqft\n\nmedian · 55 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹78.1/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹65,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.5%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹27,404/sqft** — **1% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2026\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n1 RK180–208 ft²₹49 L–₹57 L\n\nShop240 ft²₹66 L\n\n1 BHK335–339 ft²₹92 L–₹93 L\n\n2 BHK470 ft²₹1.29 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Harshail%20Hornbill%20Apartment%20(RERA%20P51800029350))\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nP51800029350\n\nRegistered\n\n2022-08-12\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n\nSTATE BANK OF INDIA\n\nArchitect\n\nShah & Associates\n\nTotal FSI\n\n3226\n\n04\n\n## Buildings · 1 Wing(s)\n\nHarshail Horbill Apartment22 floors · — units\n\n05\n\n## Land DNA · Genesis\n\n**Redevelopment / SRA / MHADA / MMRDA / Freehold** — provenance from MPE's verification layer. The genesis no portal shows.\n\n06\n\n## Loca